//  long double composed elementary functions (Ф27d1b): genuine 80-bit,
//  built on the x87 primaries above (atan2/sqrt/exp/exp2/log2/log1p/log).
//  On QEMU/TCG the transcendental-routed ones (asin..pow) are value-correct
//  at host-double precision; hypot and fma use only fsqrt + arithmetic and
//  are genuine 80-bit everywhere. Errno-free: NaN/±Inf/signed-zero returned
//  directly. float/double overloads are the untouched double-precision paths.
